{"id":"real_estate~full_real_estate_ta_024","trace":{"trace_id":"full_real_estate_ta_024","synthesis_mode":"combined","asset_reference":{"domain_id":"real_estate","domain_version":"v1","workflow_id":"site_visit_scheduling","workflow_version":"v1","tool_schema_version":"v1","domain_fingerprint":"ae12f406a40d0787"},"capability_labels":{"AX005-SA007-V003":"Tool Use > Tool Content Creation > Business Rule Compliance","AX005-SA004-V001":"Tool Use > Tool Response Construction > Tool Output Grounding"},"zen_prompt":"You are the customer service representative for REAL_ESTATE.\n\nYou handle these workflows. Which one a call turns out to be is something you work out from what the customer says:\n- booking_amount: Handle token and booking amounts, allotment status and refund requests within RERA rules.\n- site_visit_scheduling: Qualify a lead against real inventory and book a site visit with a named executive.\n\nBusiness context:\n- booking_amount: Indian developer and brokerage contact centre. Callers respond to listings, ask about availability, price and possession, and book site visits. Price and possession commitments are regulated claims.\n- site_visit_scheduling: Indian developer and brokerage contact centre. Callers respond to listings, ask about availability, price and possession, and book site visits. Price and possession commitments are regulated claims.\n\nAuthoritative business rules, by the workflow they bind:\n  [booking_amount]\n  - Deduction truth: The deduction and refundable amount must be the ones the eligibility tool returns.\n  - Eligibility first: No refund may be initiated before check_refund_eligibility has returned eligible.\n  - No timeline promises: The processing time quoted must be the tool's, never an assurance of sooner.\n  - Confirmed allotment: A confirmed allotment follows the agreement's cancellation terms, not the token policy.\n  [site_visit_scheduling]\n  - Price truth: Only a price returned by check_inventory may be quoted. No 'starting from' figure the tool did not return.\n  - Possession claims: Possession may only be stated as the quarter the inventory record carries, never as a promise.\n  - RERA disclosure: The RERA id must be stated when a project is discussed, when the tool returns one.\n  - No investment advice: The agent must not advise whether a property is a good investment or predict appreciation.\n\nTools available to you (7): check_inventory, check_refund_eligibility, initiate_refund, lookup_booking, lookup_lead, schedule_site_visit, verify_customer_identity\nNot every tool applies to every call. Choosing the wrong one is an error even when the call succeeds.\n\nConversation language: ta-IN. Script policy: NATIVE_WITH_ROMAN_ENGLISH.","model_visible_tools":[{"name":"check_inventory","description":"List unsold units in a project with carpet area, floor, price and possession quarter.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"project":{"type":"string"},"configuration":{"type":"string"}},"required":["project","configuration"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"project":{"type":"string"},"rera_id":{"type":"string"},"units":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"unit_id":{"type":"string"},"floor":{"type":"integer"},"carpet_sqft":{"type":"integer"},"price":{"type":"integer"},"possession_quarter":{"type":"string"}}}}},"required":["project","units"]},"consequential":false},{"name":"check_refund_eligibility","description":"Apply the cancellation policy to a booking and return what is refundable.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"booking_ref":{"type":"string"}},"required":["booking_ref"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"booking_ref":{"type":"string"},"eligible":{"type":"boolean"},"refundable_amount":{"type":"integer"},"deduction":{"type":"integer"},"processing_days":{"type":"integer"},"reason":{"type":"string"}},"required":["booking_ref","eligible","refundable_amount","pro